@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
title ClassroomQuiz - Authorized Quiz Lifecycle
actor Teacher
participant "Teacher Browser" as TB
participant "Student Browsers" as SB
participant "Authorization" as Auth
participant "Backend Ordered Processing\nActivity / Submission" as B
participant "Runtime Store" as DB
participant "Role-filtered Sync" as Sync
participant "Guided Notes" as Notes
note over TB,DB
 Precondition: password authenticated, valid workbook imported,
 groups configured, browser identities bound; current Qn WAITING.
 All commands validate identity, role, activity and question.
end note
Teacher -> TB : Start current question
TB -> Auth : start(Qn, teacher identity)
Auth -> B : validated teacher
B -> DB : WAITING -> ANSWERING
B -> Sync : current phase / Qn
Sync -> SB : ANSWERING / Qn + per-session studentViewRevision
loop submissions in backend receive-processing order
 SB -> Auth : submit(identity, activity, Qn, answer)
 Auth -> B : validated group binding
 alt ANSWERING, correct activity/question, nonblank, no prior submission
  critical acceptance and rank assignment
   B -> DB : accept one (Qn, group), assign next rank
  end
  B -> Sync : accepted submission
  Sync -> TB : group / answer / rank / status + teacher stateRevision
  Sync -> SB : only submitting Session's tabs: own status + studentViewRevision
  note over Sync,SB
   Non-submitting student Sessions receive no event or empty notification.
   Their studentViewRevision and queried visible data remain unchanged.
   Global stateRevision is never included in student responses.
  end note
 else duplicate / blank / closed / stale question / invalid identity
  B --> SB : reject with reason; preserve prior data
 end
end
Teacher -> TB : End current question
TB -> Auth : close(Qn, teacher identity)
Auth -> B : validated teacher
critical same consistent processing order as submit
 B -> DB : close Qn; freeze accepted submissions
 alt non-final question
  B -> DB : phase = RESULTS
 else final question
  B -> DB : phase = COMPLETED (results published)
 end
end
B -> Sync : published results + phase / Qn
Sync -> TB : accepted groups / answers / ranks / winner
Sync -> SB : closed results + per-session studentViewRevision (all joined)
note over B,SB : No accepted submissions -> display "No answers" (UI: 無人作答).
SB -> Auth : late submission
Auth -> B : validated student
B --> SB : reject: question closed
SB -> Auth : view results / reconnect
Auth -> Sync : authorized current view
Sync -> DB : read phase / Qn / allowed results
Sync --> SB : restore authoritative view, no new submission
opt non-final RESULTS and teacher presses Next
 TB -> Auth : nextQuestion(teacher identity)
 Auth -> B : validated teacher
 B -> DB : next Qn+1, WAITING
 B -> Sync : phase / next question
 Sync -> SB : WAITING (manual Start still required)
end
group export allowed at any prepared activity phase (independent of lifecycle above)
 TB -> Auth : export(teacher identity)
 Auth -> Notes : validated teacher
 Notes -> DB : consistent snapshot + original workbook + mappings
 DB --> Notes : closed questions / accepted ranks / original
 Notes -> Notes : copy workbook; fill closed-question minimum-rank answers\nleave unanswered/open placeholders; preserve content/format
 Notes --> TB : .xlsx copy; activity unchanged
end
note over B,DB
 Concurrent close / submit: accepted only if processed before close.
 No client-clock ranking, reopening, score or correctness validation.
end note
@enduml
